        "Content": "<ul><li> Exceptional Connemara countryside estate set in an idyllic scenic location</li><li> Approx. 2.47 acres with substantial land and excellent potential</li><li> Distinctive farmhouse-style residence built c. 1937</li><li> Separate 60 sq.m. (646 sq.ft.) workshop with independent access</li><li> Traditional outbuildings offering storage, workshop and potential conversion opportunities</li><li> Charming two-storey stone building with original features and significant restoration potential</li><li> Located on the R336 Coastal Route, just 1 km from Connemara Airport</li><li> Panoramic views across Galway Bay, The Burren and all three Aran Islands</li><li> Rare opportunity for refurbishment, redevelopment or alternative uses, subject to planning permission</ul>"
